cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MultiRadial, please cite the software and accompanying method paper."
title: "MultiRadial: Centre-conditioned radial analysis for irregular and multi-centred structures"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "de Souza"
    given-names: "Rafael S."
version: "0.1.0.dev0"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
abstract: >-
  MultiRadial constructs support-constrained centre distances,
  centre-associated regions, relative centre-boundary depth, normalized
  progression, and centre-conditioned radial profiles for irregular and
  multi-centred structures.
